WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.049
[opening theme music playing]

00:36.119 --> 00:38.038
- [maid Kim] Thank you for the tour.
- [landlord] Please let me know

00:38.121 --> 00:39.622
- if you are interested.
- We will.

00:41.916 --> 00:42.751
[maid Kim exhales]

00:43.460 --> 00:47.464
The location is right in between
Jinyowon and Songrim.

00:48.423 --> 00:50.675
And the roof tiles
and floors are clean, too.

00:50.759 --> 00:53.344
This is the best house we've seen so far.

00:53.428 --> 00:56.306
Don't you think there are
too many rooms in this house?

00:56.389 --> 00:58.141
Surely, they'll have children soon.

00:58.224 --> 01:01.269
If they have a son, he'll take
the surname Park and lead Songrim.

01:01.352 --> 01:04.939
If it's a daughter, she'll take
the surname Jin and lead Jinyowon.

01:05.023 --> 01:06.399
They should have many children.

01:07.150 --> 01:10.987
I did well to ask you to join me
on this house tour, Maidservant Kim.

01:11.071 --> 01:14.866
I will most certainly pick
the one you like the most.

01:14.949 --> 01:15.909
[laughs softly]

01:19.746 --> 01:20.789
To be honest,

01:21.664 --> 01:25.585
I do not wish to live
in a very big house like that.

01:26.753 --> 01:29.130
I would much prefer a cozy little house

01:29.631 --> 01:33.426
where my husband
and I can live happily together.

01:34.260 --> 01:35.094
[laughs softly]

01:35.178 --> 01:36.846
It would be nice to have a small garden

01:36.930 --> 01:38.640
where I can plant
my favorite flowers, too.

01:38.723 --> 01:39.766
[laughs]

01:39.849 --> 01:42.727
You like flowers, right, Maidservant Kim?

01:44.270 --> 01:45.188
[exhales]

01:45.271 --> 01:46.940
Shall I plant balsam flowers?

01:47.482 --> 01:51.027
We'll pick them when they bloom and
use them to dye each other's fingernails.

01:51.653 --> 01:52.487
[chuckles]

01:53.238 --> 01:56.741
It would be so wonderful
to live happily like that.

01:58.743 --> 02:01.287
I'll try to look for a house…

02:02.997 --> 02:04.290
just like that.

02:10.380 --> 02:11.506
Yes?

02:11.589 --> 02:15.051
I will plant balsam seeds in the garden

02:16.010 --> 02:17.804
of a cozy little house,

02:18.680 --> 02:21.182
and gift it to you when you get married,

02:22.642 --> 02:23.726
Maidservant Kim.

02:24.811 --> 02:25.645
Hmm?

02:27.856 --> 02:29.482
So, it'll be a gift?

02:29.566 --> 02:33.278
Since Master Lee so adored
the dog, Sapsali,

02:34.070 --> 02:37.615
I will also gift you
a small puppy like that.

02:38.283 --> 02:43.079
Are you seriously telling me that
I should wed Master Lee right now?

02:43.163 --> 02:48.293
Well, did you not say
just looking at him made you happy?

02:49.085 --> 02:54.257
Oh, you thought the person I had
feelings for was Master Lee Cheol?

02:55.174 --> 02:59.095
I, too, am at least that observant.

02:59.178 --> 03:02.849
So your observation is telling you
to give me a gift when I marry him?

03:03.516 --> 03:04.893
A house for us to live in?

03:05.518 --> 03:09.981
I can… give at least
that much as a gift for you.

03:10.982 --> 03:11.858
Why?

03:12.650 --> 03:15.945
Then buy me a house with 100 rooms.
I thought you were well-off.

03:16.529 --> 03:17.405
A hundred?

03:17.906 --> 03:19.574
[gasps]
Ah!

03:19.657 --> 03:22.160
Did you actually prefer a bigger house?

03:22.243 --> 03:23.786
- [Jin laughs]
- [exasperated sigh]

03:24.454 --> 03:27.582
You see, I am a bit slow.
[laughs]

03:27.665 --> 03:28.958
Are you an idiot?

03:30.084 --> 03:32.003
You are the one I have feelings for.

03:43.681 --> 03:44.891
[sobbing] I was hoping

03:46.017 --> 03:48.144
you would catch on sooner or later.

03:48.228 --> 03:52.607
While cooking your favorite dishes
and making your clothes,

03:52.690 --> 03:57.195
I thought this slow-witted man
would one day notice my true feelings.

03:58.488 --> 03:59.656
I was waiting for that.

04:00.531 --> 04:01.574
But…

04:02.200 --> 04:03.993
you want me to marry someone else?

04:04.786 --> 04:06.788
And you will buy a house for me
to live in with that man?

04:07.956 --> 04:09.123
Maid Kim.

04:09.749 --> 04:11.376
[breathes shakily]
I, uh…

04:12.335 --> 04:13.628
have misunderstood you.

04:13.711 --> 04:14.712
You shut up!

04:16.422 --> 04:19.425
Today, as we were looking
at houses together just then,

04:20.635 --> 04:24.138
I dreamed of the day when the two of us
would finally be together as well.

04:24.681 --> 04:26.641
I imagined how happy I would be

04:27.308 --> 04:29.227
picking balsam flowers in my garden

04:29.769 --> 04:32.146
and lovingly grinding them
to dye each other's fingernails.

04:34.691 --> 04:36.651
[softly] Love? Love!

04:36.734 --> 04:39.195
That's right! Now, you know.

04:39.737 --> 04:40.697
Lovey-dovey together!

04:43.157 --> 04:44.784
Lovey-dovey!

04:44.867 --> 04:47.328
Yes! Oh, yes! Lovey-dovey!

04:48.621 --> 04:52.500
I can also imagine
that scene so vividly now.

04:52.583 --> 04:53.668
Forget it now.

04:53.751 --> 04:55.253
That dream has been crushed,

04:55.336 --> 04:58.047
and I will no longer expect
anything from you anymore, my lord.

04:58.965 --> 05:02.135
Oh, I will accept a house
with 100 rooms when I get married.

05:02.218 --> 05:03.052
[maid Kim scoffs]

05:03.845 --> 05:05.888
- Maidservant Kim!
- [cries]

05:06.723 --> 05:07.598
Maidservant Kim!

05:09.017 --> 05:10.351
[maid Kim sobs]

05:10.435 --> 05:11.853
Maidservant Kim. Maidservant Kim!

05:14.272 --> 05:15.440
Lovey-dovey!

05:16.566 --> 05:19.986
I… have ruined everything.

05:22.447 --> 05:23.364
You fool.

05:25.575 --> 05:27.118
[sniffling]

05:27.201 --> 05:28.036
Fine.

05:28.619 --> 05:31.539
Just you wait and see me get married!

05:31.622 --> 05:33.624
You'd better get me that house with rooms.

05:34.125 --> 05:35.335
[sobbing]

05:35.418 --> 05:36.961
Oh, Maid Kim, there you are.

05:38.046 --> 05:40.423
Maid Kim, you're crying?

05:40.506 --> 05:43.009
Of course not. Why would I?

05:45.470 --> 05:47.472
You are crying. Who made you cry?

05:47.555 --> 05:50.183
Seeing you like this
really breaks my heart.

05:50.266 --> 05:51.184
[sighs]

05:51.267 --> 05:52.810
I was feeling jealous

05:52.894 --> 05:56.981
that Young Master Park is getting married
before my young master Uk.

05:57.565 --> 05:59.817
Made me jealous and upset, so I'm sad.

05:59.901 --> 06:02.945
There is no need to be jealous or upset.
I'll be getting married soon as well.

06:03.529 --> 06:04.363
What?

06:05.239 --> 06:08.701
Have you finally decided
to get married, then?

06:08.785 --> 06:12.747
Yes. So, Maidservant Kim,
you have nothing to be upset about, hmm.

06:12.830 --> 06:13.956
Gosh!

06:14.040 --> 06:16.125
Well, then I should just leave these here.

06:17.794 --> 06:19.045
What is all this?

06:19.128 --> 06:21.798
They're the wedding gifts
I prepared for when you get married.

06:22.340 --> 06:25.259
I wanted to give them
to Young Master Park and Young Lady Jin.

06:25.343 --> 06:27.553
Why would you do that, though?
That's such a waste.

06:27.637 --> 06:28.638
Indeed!

06:28.721 --> 06:31.140
I should give them
to Young Lady Heo, then?

06:32.642 --> 06:34.102
Now, why would you give her these?

06:34.185 --> 06:36.270
Gosh! You said you were getting married.

06:36.354 --> 06:37.939
I already know everything.

06:38.022 --> 06:40.024
She is your bird egg.

06:42.360 --> 06:45.321
- Bird egg?
- Your big love, that's a secret, hmm.

06:45.905 --> 06:49.742
The egret that hatches aloofly
at the top of a tall tree.

06:50.368 --> 06:52.203
Uh… [nervous chuckle]

06:52.286 --> 06:55.331
I think you have misunderstood.
That is not the right bird.

06:56.332 --> 06:57.959
- It's not her?
- No.

06:58.042 --> 07:02.088
Oh, I thought it was obviously her
who would be hatched from the egg. No?

07:02.880 --> 07:05.299
Then, you're sure there is someone else?

07:06.592 --> 07:08.136
Mm-hmm, you're right.

07:08.678 --> 07:09.762
[inhales deeply]

07:09.846 --> 07:10.680
Who?

07:12.557 --> 07:15.435
Maidservant Kim,
do not be startled and just listen.

07:15.518 --> 07:16.936
If you feel like
you will bite your tongue,

07:17.019 --> 07:18.604
bite your handkerchief instead.

07:20.273 --> 07:22.608
I mean, who could it be, then?

07:23.317 --> 07:24.986
What other women do you have around you?

07:26.154 --> 07:27.572
[quirky music playing]

07:27.655 --> 07:28.990
[gasps]

07:34.036 --> 07:35.329
Don't tell me…

07:36.664 --> 07:39.083
That's right. This all belongs to Mu-deok.

07:39.584 --> 07:40.460
[gasps]

07:41.836 --> 07:43.796
[exclaims]

07:45.089 --> 07:46.966
[exclaims in denial]

07:47.049 --> 07:50.470
That cannot be! It's Mu-deok?
What happened to Young Lady Heo?

07:50.553 --> 07:52.263
[screams]

07:53.639 --> 07:56.642
It looks like things worked out
for you and Young Master Jang in the end.

07:57.143 --> 07:58.019
Yes.

07:58.102 --> 08:00.396
I've decided I'm going
to get married to him.

08:00.480 --> 08:02.815
You know I am fond of spreading rumors.

08:02.899 --> 08:03.941
Please, do so.

08:04.609 --> 08:06.736
- Mu-deok has changed her fate.
- [laughs]

08:07.320 --> 08:09.280
Well, if it gets out
that he is marrying you,

08:09.363 --> 08:10.948
that will clear up all the nasty rumors.

08:11.616 --> 08:12.783
"Nasty rumors"?

08:12.867 --> 08:15.286
You know, the rumor that he was impotent

08:15.953 --> 08:17.288
because he practiced chastity.

08:18.122 --> 08:19.207
That's not true!

08:19.290 --> 08:21.709
That's what everyone said. Not true?

08:21.792 --> 08:23.669
Oh! No, definitely not!

08:23.753 --> 08:25.296
[Ju-wol] Gosh! Ah!

08:25.379 --> 08:26.964
So you've already confirmed that.

08:28.508 --> 08:29.634
What do you mean? Confirmed what?

08:29.717 --> 08:33.012
Now, I see! That is why
you've chosen to marry him.

08:33.095 --> 08:35.348
What woman would marry an impotent man

08:35.431 --> 08:37.308
even if he was from the Jang family?

08:37.391 --> 08:38.726
Do not worry, Mu-deok!

08:38.809 --> 08:40.686
I'll make sure everyone knows.

08:40.770 --> 08:42.688
"She checked, and he's definitely okay."

08:42.772 --> 08:44.398
We have not done it yet!

08:45.358 --> 08:47.318
We seriously have not done it yet!
I swear!

08:47.401 --> 08:48.236
[chuckles]

08:48.319 --> 08:50.613
I am older, there's no need
to be embarrassed.

08:51.280 --> 08:52.323
- Goodness me!
- [exhales deeply]

08:54.283 --> 08:56.702
You were just full of anger
when we first met here.

08:56.786 --> 08:58.538
But you seem to have a heart now.

09:00.915 --> 09:03.376
For some reason, I always thought that

09:03.459 --> 09:05.545
you would cut all ties
and disappear one day.

09:07.338 --> 09:10.550
Well, I told you. I changed my fate.

09:11.676 --> 09:15.346
I will not disappear
and protect those I love as well.

09:16.639 --> 09:18.099
You must like him a lot.

09:19.642 --> 09:20.476
[chuckles]

09:21.602 --> 09:24.689
Have a good future! A happy one.

09:28.025 --> 09:28.859
[laughs gently]

09:32.363 --> 09:36.784
[Jin Mu] I will find the sword for you
that can destroy Jang Uk's light.

09:37.410 --> 09:41.372
I, Jin Mu, am the only one
who can help you destroy the King's Star.

09:41.914 --> 09:44.000
Jang Uk has already lost all his energy.

09:45.293 --> 09:47.628
He gave up all his power
to break the barrier.

09:48.963 --> 09:52.258
He was even stripped of his right
to be the next Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

09:52.341 --> 09:54.218
He has no power anymore.

09:55.553 --> 09:58.723
And everyone already thinks that
the King's Star from that day is mine.

10:00.766 --> 10:04.729
There is nothing more
that you can do… for me.

10:07.732 --> 10:09.900
Jang Gang may have paid
for the misdeeds of Songrim,

10:09.984 --> 10:12.028
Jinyowon, and Cheongbugwan with his death,

10:12.111 --> 10:15.114
but since Jin U-tak is still alive,
your crime will be exposed.

10:16.616 --> 10:19.160
I do not want to punish someone
who was once my master.

10:20.202 --> 10:23.372
Come forward and accept
the punishment for your crimes.

10:27.752 --> 10:29.879
Do you truly think the ice stone is gone?

10:31.922 --> 10:34.300
That power is the energy of the skies.

10:34.383 --> 10:36.844
The one born under the King's Star
and is granted permission

10:37.345 --> 10:39.138
can harness that power.

10:40.598 --> 10:42.266
What will you do if Jang Uk

10:43.517 --> 10:46.395
has that power and is merely hiding it?

10:54.195 --> 10:55.905
I will wait for your reply, Your Highness.

10:57.073 --> 10:59.575
My loyalty will forever belong to you.

11:20.221 --> 11:23.849
You haven't spoken
when you have regained consciousness.

11:26.894 --> 11:31.107
I saved you so you could have
the chance to atone for your sins

11:32.274 --> 11:33.734
to our beloved daughter,

11:35.111 --> 11:36.695
our Bu-yeon.

11:37.863 --> 11:39.198
[breathes shakily]

11:41.283 --> 11:42.785
When I first saw you…

11:45.371 --> 11:47.206
I fell for your warm smile.

11:49.750 --> 11:50.626
[laughs]

11:50.709 --> 11:52.169
This one is pretty, too.

11:52.253 --> 11:56.173
I think this one will look pretty
on Bu-yeon as well.

11:59.009 --> 12:01.929
[Ho-gyeong] Ever since the moment
I fell for you,

12:03.305 --> 12:04.557
I truly have

12:05.933 --> 12:07.643
never been able to love

12:09.228 --> 12:10.312
anyone else.

12:17.486 --> 12:19.697
I'm not saying this to resolve anything,

12:20.573 --> 12:24.243
I'm only saying this
to make you really suffer.

12:28.122 --> 12:31.834
I just want you to understand
exactly what you did to our daughter.

12:33.169 --> 12:34.211
Jin Mu has lied.

12:34.795 --> 12:37.590
I hope you'll be in agony.

12:38.132 --> 12:39.550
[breathes shakily]

13:00.905 --> 13:02.364
[Yeom-su] Jin U-tak is in Sejukwon.

13:03.199 --> 13:04.575
He's regained consciousness.

13:05.326 --> 13:06.911
If he is still alive,

13:07.536 --> 13:10.414
it will be impossible to hide
my connection to our order.

13:10.498 --> 13:12.124
We must get rid of him.

13:18.589 --> 13:21.175
[court lady] I have brought
soul potions from the apothecary

13:21.258 --> 13:24.220
and the Queen's divination bells
from the palace, as you commanded.

13:28.307 --> 13:30.309
[ominous music playing]

13:40.110 --> 13:41.904
[bell jingling]

13:52.915 --> 13:54.625
[maid 1] Help, my lord!

13:55.459 --> 13:56.293
[groans]

13:56.377 --> 13:58.045
- [screams]
- [man yells angrily]

14:01.006 --> 14:03.175
[grunts]

14:03.259 --> 14:04.385
[roars]

14:05.469 --> 14:07.012
- [maid 2] Please, spare us!
- [roars]

14:07.513 --> 14:09.265
[laughs]

14:22.486 --> 14:24.405
With this, I can make
all the soul shifters

14:24.488 --> 14:26.907
I have created go on a rampage.

14:28.951 --> 14:31.328
If Jang Uk really does have
the ice stone's power,

14:32.538 --> 14:34.498
he will not be able to hide it.

14:41.797 --> 14:43.632
[Jang Uk]
Please, craft two rings with these.

14:44.216 --> 14:45.259
[merchant exclaims]

14:46.010 --> 14:48.178
Seeing how you're ordering matching rings.

14:48.262 --> 14:50.306
I guess all those rumors
are true, aren't they?

14:50.389 --> 14:51.724
[merchant laughs]

14:51.807 --> 14:54.101
They are wedding rings,
so please, take extra care, okay?

14:54.184 --> 14:57.563
Gosh, of course!
I will do my utmost. Absolutely!

14:57.646 --> 15:00.566
Please, take a look here
at these wonderful designs.

15:00.649 --> 15:01.942
Which do you like?

15:02.026 --> 15:02.943
[Jang Uk] I like this one.

15:03.027 --> 15:04.653
- Oh, no! Uh…
- [Mu-deok] Hmm.

15:04.737 --> 15:06.322
[laughs awkwardly]

15:06.405 --> 15:08.657
- That one is, well…
- Huh?

15:08.741 --> 15:10.534
That was Young Lady Yeong-ok's.

15:10.618 --> 15:12.578
- [stutters] Oh, this one…
- Yes, yes!

15:12.661 --> 15:14.038
That's not pretty at all.

15:15.039 --> 15:16.582
[clears throat] Then what about this one?

15:16.665 --> 15:18.459
No! Huh… [laughs awkwardly]

15:18.542 --> 15:19.543
[stutters] That is…

15:19.627 --> 15:21.378
- Young Lady So-jeong's.
- No! Never mind.

15:21.462 --> 15:23.130
All of these, they are all… all ugly.

15:23.213 --> 15:26.550
Then, I will take out
all the ugly ones, yes, um…

15:26.634 --> 15:30.137
All right, um, these, and, uh, these…

15:30.220 --> 15:31.597
And these too.

15:31.680 --> 15:33.891
I will put these here.
All right, all right, all right!

15:33.974 --> 15:36.477
Feel free to choose
from the remaining ones.

15:36.560 --> 15:37.770
- Any of them. [laughs awkwardly]
- [sighs]

15:37.853 --> 15:40.064
Seven rings?

15:41.690 --> 15:42.858
[merchant groans]

15:42.942 --> 15:44.860
[quirky music playing]

15:52.534 --> 15:53.535
[Jang Uk] Thank you, thank you.

15:54.203 --> 15:55.245
Wait, um…

15:56.080 --> 15:59.166
I don't really think there were seven.
I don't remember a single one.

15:59.249 --> 16:02.086
Did all those rings have
similar stories to you and Cho-yeon?

16:02.169 --> 16:04.129
You promised to marry them
if they opened your gate of energy?

16:04.213 --> 16:06.006
I swear. I never made
a move with any of them.

16:06.090 --> 16:09.593
Once you said you needed to make
an effort not to like a handsome man.

16:09.677 --> 16:12.221
So, you know, all these women,
uh, did not try their very best.

16:12.304 --> 16:13.931
You're so annoying!

16:14.014 --> 16:16.266
And also, I am all yours now.

16:16.350 --> 16:17.851
Rather than winning my heart for free,

16:17.935 --> 16:19.853
don't you feel proud
to have beaten the competition?

16:19.937 --> 16:20.771
[gasps]

16:20.854 --> 16:21.897
Wow!

16:21.981 --> 16:24.692
I would have been prouder
had there been a dozen more.

16:24.775 --> 16:26.360
Such a shame, right?

16:26.443 --> 16:28.028
Why? Do you think I cannot?

16:29.989 --> 16:31.991
I'm just kidding, all right?
You're the only one.

16:32.074 --> 16:33.492
I tossed the rings and forgot the girls.

16:33.575 --> 16:34.743
Hold on a minute.

16:35.703 --> 16:37.830
I did see a few rings
while I was cleaning your room.

16:38.580 --> 16:39.623
I must go and look for them.

16:39.707 --> 16:42.960
Oh! Why would you look for
such meaningless things?

16:43.043 --> 16:45.587
No, no. I think there really were
a dozen of them.

16:46.672 --> 16:48.173
Let go. I need to go check.

16:53.887 --> 16:55.139
I said there are none.

16:57.933 --> 16:59.643
Mu-deok, shall we go eat now?

17:01.228 --> 17:02.354
[sighs]

17:02.438 --> 17:03.647
Be honest with me.

17:04.314 --> 17:05.399
How many rings?

17:10.988 --> 17:11.822
[Jang Uk] Just one.

17:12.322 --> 17:15.034
You are the one that
I will be wearing for the rest of my life.

17:16.285 --> 17:18.829
I have never given
such a ring to anyone else.

17:20.039 --> 17:20.914
Well…

17:21.999 --> 17:24.001
since we're wearing rings
around our fingers,

17:24.668 --> 17:27.129
we won't need to make any
with the yin-yang jade.

17:27.212 --> 17:28.088
Hmm.

17:29.798 --> 17:31.508
Should we make necklaces instead?

17:32.092 --> 17:33.635
[Mu-deok] Do as you please.

17:33.719 --> 17:35.387
[Jang Uk]
I'm not jealous of Dang-gu one bit.

17:36.930 --> 17:38.015
[Mu-deok] I'm not jealous of
Cho-yeon, either.

17:38.098 --> 17:40.184
I-I guess the rumors
about those two are true.

17:40.267 --> 17:42.770
That annoying young master
is smiling all giddy.

17:44.104 --> 17:44.938
You are right.

17:45.481 --> 17:47.566
I suppose from the moment we met,

17:48.942 --> 17:50.319
I was mistaken.

17:51.403 --> 17:52.321
How embarrassing.

17:53.405 --> 17:54.531
Young Lady.

17:55.324 --> 17:59.078
Don't tell me you confessed your love
to him when you were trapped together.

17:59.703 --> 18:02.372
I was going to. And I almost did.

18:03.832 --> 18:05.042
I had my chance.

18:14.218 --> 18:16.303
You do not need to hold
that light up for me, Yun-ok.

18:16.887 --> 18:18.138
You can put it down.

18:19.932 --> 18:22.601
Are you uncomfortable
that I am here with you?

18:23.143 --> 18:24.603
I feel all right.

18:25.521 --> 18:26.396
[smacks lips]

18:26.480 --> 18:27.815
Do as you please, then.

18:30.442 --> 18:31.568
Hmm.

18:31.652 --> 18:34.279
When you were drunk
and lying down in Sejukwon,

18:34.363 --> 18:37.032
you were comfortable with me
taking care of you all night.

18:37.574 --> 18:38.992
Because I thought you were Mu-deok.

18:49.962 --> 18:53.173
So that is the expression
he makes when he likes someone.

18:53.924 --> 18:55.634
Young Master Jang should have been the one

18:55.717 --> 18:57.553
to get hurt in there
instead of Master Seo.

18:57.636 --> 19:00.180
Then, you two could have
possibly gotten closer.

19:01.807 --> 19:03.892
Because you take care of those
who are hurt.

19:05.018 --> 19:06.478
[chuckles] Do you think so?

19:08.063 --> 19:09.606
Had he gotten injured…

19:12.442 --> 19:14.194
would I have had a chance?

19:21.743 --> 19:24.037
[Beom] Yul, I heard you were returning
to Seoho Fortress.

19:24.121 --> 19:26.415
Yes, I decided to leave
after Dang-gu's wedding.

19:26.498 --> 19:29.251
- Let us have a farewell party before then.
- All right.

19:33.964 --> 19:34.798
[groaning]

19:41.054 --> 19:43.932
[Yun-ok] You're still in pain
even though your wound has healed?

19:45.893 --> 19:48.979
[Seo Yul] I thought it would get better,
but it keeps hurting.

19:49.730 --> 19:51.773
Could you tell me
if something else happened

19:52.274 --> 19:53.692
while I was unconscious?

19:53.775 --> 19:57.696
All I did was stop the bleeding
from your open wound.

19:59.031 --> 19:59.907
Oh.

20:00.782 --> 20:03.660
So-i ran away. She gave you her blood.

20:05.037 --> 20:05.871
[Yun-ok sighs]

20:06.538 --> 20:08.832
You cannot give blood this way, So-i.

20:09.416 --> 20:11.501
Why did you injure yourself so recklessly?

20:13.003 --> 20:14.379
I just…

20:14.463 --> 20:17.090
really wanted to save him, no matter what.

20:20.802 --> 20:23.764
Her blood was indeed
able to enter your wound.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.892
But that should not be a problem.

20:26.975 --> 20:28.310
I'm sure I will recover soon.

20:29.186 --> 20:32.064
I do not want the others to worry,
so please, keep it quiet.

20:33.232 --> 20:34.441
[man laughs]

20:34.524 --> 20:37.236
All right, all right. Drink up. Yeah.
[laughs]

20:38.612 --> 20:40.614
Hey, what are you doing there?

20:40.697 --> 20:41.615
- [man] Huh?
- [So-i gasps]

20:42.115 --> 20:43.909
Hey, what did you steal?

20:44.493 --> 20:46.578
Ugh! What is this? What's wrong with you?

20:46.662 --> 20:48.538
Hey! Stop there!

21:08.350 --> 21:11.561
The wound where the blood parasite
came out does not heal easily.

21:16.900 --> 21:18.235
[breathes heavily]

21:22.072 --> 21:22.906
[groans]

21:23.991 --> 21:25.909
There is a blood parasite in him.

21:29.496 --> 21:30.330
[sighs]

21:30.414 --> 21:31.832
He must be in pain.

21:33.250 --> 21:36.128
He needs the medicine I took
at Jinyowon to relieve the pain.

21:42.426 --> 21:43.385
Oh, Mu-deok.

21:46.888 --> 21:49.891
You should stop being
a servant in this house now.

21:50.809 --> 21:53.562
Why? Are you kicking me out?

21:53.645 --> 21:55.689
If I really tried
kicking you out, you'd leave?

21:55.772 --> 21:58.317
- No.
- Then why would you say that

21:58.400 --> 21:59.943
if you are not going to leave anyway?

22:02.654 --> 22:04.489
Do not do such chores anymore.

22:05.574 --> 22:09.036
You will be his precious wife after all,
so I cannot make you do more chores.

22:10.454 --> 22:13.248
So, does that mean you accept me?

22:13.332 --> 22:16.126
What choice do I have
when the young master loves you that much?

22:17.919 --> 22:21.548
Oh, and also, I refuse to
address you as "my lady".

22:21.631 --> 22:22.507
Gosh.

22:22.591 --> 22:24.384
I won't consider you
my mother-in-law, either.

22:24.468 --> 22:27.304
Why would I be your mother-in-law
when I'm not married?

22:27.387 --> 22:28.388
That would hurt my pride.

22:29.014 --> 22:29.848
That's true.

22:30.682 --> 22:33.518
But you and Lord Park
will get married soon, too, won't you?

22:35.771 --> 22:37.939
I mean, that is how it looked.

22:42.819 --> 22:43.653
[sobs]

22:44.404 --> 22:45.238
Goodness.

22:46.823 --> 22:48.075
M-Maidservant Kim.

22:48.950 --> 22:51.369
Even you can see it, but only he can't.

22:51.953 --> 22:53.705
- What should I do?
- Hold on.

22:53.789 --> 22:56.249
It is so obvious!
How could he possibly not know?

22:56.333 --> 22:57.542
Wow, is he a fool?

22:57.626 --> 22:59.002
He is a fool. A fool!

23:00.128 --> 23:00.962
[sobs]

23:01.046 --> 23:02.172
I can't with him.

23:04.174 --> 23:08.220
[maid Kim] That's right! Now, you know.
Lovey-dovey together.

23:09.221 --> 23:10.764
I cannot stop…

23:12.140 --> 23:13.642
thinking about

23:14.226 --> 23:15.519
what Maid Kim…

23:16.812 --> 23:18.230
has said to me.

23:28.949 --> 23:29.950
Uh, my lord.

23:35.205 --> 23:36.039
Uk.

23:36.832 --> 23:39.459
Oh, when did you get here?

23:39.543 --> 23:42.337
I have been here for a while. I had
something I want to discuss with you.

23:42.420 --> 23:45.090
What was it that
you were thinking that hard about?

23:46.133 --> 23:47.384
There is…

23:48.760 --> 23:50.053
something bothering me.

23:50.929 --> 23:53.056
So, what did you want to discuss?

23:53.140 --> 23:54.933
Oh, well, you see,

23:55.016 --> 23:57.686
I was thinking about leaving
the capital for some time

23:57.769 --> 23:59.980
after Dang-gu and Cho-yeon's wedding.

24:00.063 --> 24:00.981
Oh, I see.

24:03.316 --> 24:04.151
Then…

24:05.777 --> 24:07.362
what about Maidservant Kim?

24:08.530 --> 24:09.447
Oh.

24:09.531 --> 24:12.617
If nobody asks her to stay here,
I can't leave her alone.

24:12.701 --> 24:14.161
I'll take her with me.

24:14.870 --> 24:18.248
Who knows when we'll return.
It could be one year or ten years.

24:18.331 --> 24:20.917
Or we may end up not returning forever.

24:22.752 --> 24:24.421
[sobs]

24:25.839 --> 24:28.300
I have done something

24:28.967 --> 24:31.636
unforgivable to Maidservant Kim.

24:32.429 --> 24:33.471
[sighs]

24:34.973 --> 24:36.433
If I asked her to stay,

24:36.516 --> 24:39.769
do you think that she'd be with me?

24:39.853 --> 24:40.687
Hmm…

24:41.229 --> 24:42.105
Maidservant Kim…

24:44.065 --> 24:45.025
was crying.

24:45.108 --> 24:45.942
[gasps]

24:47.068 --> 24:48.236
[sobs]

24:52.949 --> 24:56.161
She will cry even more
if you do not ask her.

25:02.375 --> 25:04.419
I will have to…

25:06.171 --> 25:07.297
just go.

25:08.882 --> 25:09.799
Not go.

25:12.260 --> 25:13.094
Go.

25:16.848 --> 25:17.849
[sighs]

25:17.933 --> 25:20.644
What is the point? Go!

25:28.235 --> 25:29.069
[sighs]

25:35.742 --> 25:38.453
There is something…

25:40.330 --> 25:42.249
that I would like to show you.

25:43.500 --> 25:45.460
[Jin breathes heavily]

25:53.218 --> 25:55.220
They are balsam flower seeds.

25:56.554 --> 25:58.181
If you plant these now,

25:59.099 --> 26:02.143
the flowers will bloom
in three to four months.

26:04.562 --> 26:08.066
I could make them bloom
in front of your eyes

26:08.149 --> 26:10.068
by using a spell right now.

26:11.236 --> 26:12.070
But…

26:14.572 --> 26:15.865
I tend to be slow.

26:21.288 --> 26:24.124
Could you wait until they sprout,

26:25.959 --> 26:27.502
bud leaves and then…

26:33.842 --> 26:35.760
finally bloom into flowers?

26:36.303 --> 26:38.305
[soft music playing]

27:08.752 --> 27:09.711
I will.

27:15.717 --> 27:16.551
I will

27:17.844 --> 27:18.928
try to go with…

27:20.180 --> 27:21.264
your slow pace.

27:22.223 --> 27:24.434
[soft music continues playing]

27:33.193 --> 27:34.152
[maid Kim chuckles]

27:39.199 --> 27:42.660
Looks like this gift will only
interrupt them now.

27:57.717 --> 27:58.551
[chuckles]

28:02.222 --> 28:03.056
[boy] Whoa!

28:03.139 --> 28:05.934
[girl] Thank you. We will enjoy the fish.

28:06.017 --> 28:07.102
[boy] Thank you.

28:18.571 --> 28:19.572
[girl] Did you see?

28:20.115 --> 28:22.700
That man was crying.

28:22.784 --> 28:27.122
I have never seen an adult cry
with their nose running like that before.

28:28.289 --> 28:30.583
He must not be feeling well.

28:30.667 --> 28:31.876
Do you think so?

28:38.883 --> 28:40.510
[sobbing]

28:59.320 --> 29:00.530
- Are you all right?
- [groans]

29:01.281 --> 29:03.366
Here. I've brought you some medicine.

29:03.450 --> 29:04.492
You should take it.

29:06.703 --> 29:08.121
[breathes heavily]

29:12.041 --> 29:15.336
Once we get Shaman Choi's brother
who is in Sejukwon to start talking,

29:15.420 --> 29:17.213
we'll be able to catch Jin Mu.

29:17.297 --> 29:20.300
There is something I must ask Jin Mu.

29:22.218 --> 29:24.804
Whether my father chose
to become a soul shifter

29:24.888 --> 29:27.223
or if there was a story behind it.

29:27.849 --> 29:29.225
Only he will know that.

29:31.478 --> 29:34.731
[maid Kim] Lord Cho Chung passed away
because of Gwanju Jang Gang.

29:35.607 --> 29:38.943
Lord Cho Chung found out
that the Gwanju had practiced sorcery.

29:39.569 --> 29:41.279
Afraid that he would tell everyone,

29:41.362 --> 29:44.574
Jin Mu decided to turn him into
a soul shifter and made him run wild.

29:44.657 --> 29:46.284
Are you telling me

29:46.367 --> 29:48.995
we killed Lord Cho
when he was actually innocent?

29:49.078 --> 29:51.206
[Chung roars]

29:55.460 --> 29:56.586
[Ho-gyeong] It is not our fault.

29:57.378 --> 29:59.214
We were not aware of the actual truth.

30:00.173 --> 30:02.675
Lord Cho is in fact wrongly accused

30:02.759 --> 30:05.512
of practicing sorcery
and killing his own family.

30:05.595 --> 30:09.265
The Gwanju implored that at least
we should try and clear Lord Cho's name.

30:09.349 --> 30:13.853
Hmm, we should discuss this
at the next Unanimous Assembly.

30:13.937 --> 30:17.106
But why did Jin Mu go
that far with Cho Chung?

30:17.190 --> 30:19.359
If he just wanted to silence Lord Cho,

30:19.442 --> 30:23.238
he should not have had a reason
to turn him into a soul shifter

30:23.321 --> 30:24.697
and to make him a killer.

30:26.991 --> 30:27.826
Jin Mu…

30:28.743 --> 30:32.288
knows everything about Uk's birth.

30:33.623 --> 30:35.041
He did that to Cho Chung,

30:35.124 --> 30:36.793
a friend of Jang Gang,

30:38.419 --> 30:40.505
solely to torture the Gwanju.

30:40.588 --> 30:41.631
That means…

30:43.091 --> 30:46.427
if Jin Mu is really caught,
he is going to expose

30:47.887 --> 30:49.138
Young Master's secret.

30:49.222 --> 30:52.809
To stop that from happening,
we have to find him,

30:54.894 --> 30:56.646
and kill him immediately.

30:59.816 --> 31:01.025
[Jin Mu sighs]

31:10.827 --> 31:14.497
If you curse
the Soul Ejector with divination,

31:14.581 --> 31:18.626
you can control the soul
that has been using it.

31:24.173 --> 31:25.466
[bell jingling]

31:27.552 --> 31:29.679
[ominous music playing]

31:30.597 --> 31:33.016
[Shaman Choi] In other words,
you can make them run wild,

31:33.850 --> 31:36.936
and then get rid of them by petrification.

31:47.363 --> 31:48.615
Shaman Choi

31:49.866 --> 31:54.287
cursed all Soul Ejectors back then
when she made them with divination.

31:55.079 --> 31:59.167
That is why I have never tried
to shift souls to this day.

32:00.877 --> 32:02.670
I will make all soul shifters

32:02.754 --> 32:06.507
in this capital run wild
just like Cho Chung.

32:12.221 --> 32:13.139
Assistant Gwanju.

32:14.223 --> 32:16.392
They say Jang Uk is going
to leave Jeongjingak.

32:18.186 --> 32:20.104
Songrim is letting him go?

32:20.188 --> 32:21.189
[Yeom-su] That is what I heard.

32:21.272 --> 32:23.441
Rumor has it that
he's leaving the capital as well.

32:23.524 --> 32:25.860
He will leave all of this behind?

32:25.944 --> 32:29.197
If the only person who will go
against the Crown Prince disappears…

32:29.280 --> 32:31.324
There is nothing more that you can do…

32:32.533 --> 32:33.409
for me.

32:34.369 --> 32:36.663
Why in the world is Uk leaving Songrim?

32:36.746 --> 32:40.166
He even consumed poison to get in there
and reached Chisu at an unbelievable pace.

32:40.249 --> 32:43.211
And now! He may even have
the ice stone's power,

32:43.294 --> 32:44.754
so what is it? Tell me why!

32:47.882 --> 32:48.716
[exhales deeply]

32:49.384 --> 32:52.136
Perhaps, he had
a change of heart, my lord.

32:57.183 --> 32:59.602
So what you're saying
is that he's changed.

32:59.686 --> 33:01.646
What could have caused him
to change like that?

33:03.982 --> 33:05.984
What could have caused him to change?

33:06.651 --> 33:10.071
People can only change for other people.

33:11.531 --> 33:14.826
Find the person who appeared
just when he began changing.

33:17.203 --> 33:18.621
That's your answer.

33:19.414 --> 33:22.625
The person who appeared
just when he began changing.

33:23.292 --> 33:25.503
I'm here to acquire Naksu's sword, sir.

33:27.922 --> 33:31.217
That is ridiculous.
It could not have been Naksu.

33:33.052 --> 33:34.929
[Jin Mu] Jang Uk used Naksu's Tansu.

33:35.513 --> 33:36.431
No.

33:37.849 --> 33:39.934
Master Lee must have taught him that.

33:40.018 --> 33:43.062
I witnessed everything while
he was living with me in Danhyanggok.

33:43.146 --> 33:46.774
And the only one at his side
was none other than his young servant.

33:46.858 --> 33:48.860
[suspenseful music playing]

33:54.657 --> 33:55.783
By any chance,

33:56.868 --> 33:59.287
is he leaving Songrim with his servant?

33:59.829 --> 34:01.956
Yes, my lord. I heard that
he is leaving with Mu-deok,

34:02.457 --> 34:04.876
the servant who has always
been following him around.

34:04.959 --> 34:06.961
[suspenseful music continues playing]

34:17.180 --> 34:18.765
[indistinct background chatter]

34:20.975 --> 34:22.977
[Mr. Lee] Is it even right
for me to ask you to come with me?

34:23.603 --> 34:25.438
You said you had a lot to buy.

34:25.980 --> 34:26.981
I'll help you carry it.

34:27.065 --> 34:28.191
[Mr. Lee laughs]

34:28.775 --> 34:30.651
[ominous music playing]

34:33.696 --> 34:35.364
If it really is her…

34:58.012 --> 34:58.846
[sneezes]

35:14.946 --> 35:16.906
[ominous music continues playing]

35:20.284 --> 35:21.410
[bell jingling]

35:25.039 --> 35:26.499
Hello, Mu-deok.

35:36.425 --> 35:39.011
- [Mr. Lee] Are you all right?
- Yes.

35:39.679 --> 35:41.597
[Mr. Lee] Did you not hear me calling you?

35:43.975 --> 35:44.976
I did.

35:45.810 --> 35:48.104
Why could I not answer you?

35:49.814 --> 35:51.774
Did you hear bells, by any chance?

35:52.650 --> 35:54.986
Hear bells? No, I did not.

35:55.570 --> 35:57.822
Hey, the quality here is not good.
Let's go, let's go.

35:57.905 --> 35:58.739
Yes.

36:02.201 --> 36:03.035
Naksu.

36:04.871 --> 36:07.206
You have given me a way to live.

36:15.756 --> 36:18.467
[Jang Uk] Oh! Oh, Master Lee, a fish!
A fish, a fish!

36:19.135 --> 36:20.928
[sighs] Ugh.

36:21.596 --> 36:22.471
Master Lee.

36:22.555 --> 36:25.766
Oh, come on now.
How many times have you let them go, huh?

36:26.392 --> 36:28.644
I have no regrets over the fish I've lost.

36:28.728 --> 36:30.396
What does that mean?

36:30.479 --> 36:32.899
If you lose them, it's just a total waste.

36:34.192 --> 36:35.985
This is just mere greed and obsession.

36:36.068 --> 36:36.903
What?

36:37.695 --> 36:42.825
However, within the loss, I encountered
the pure sadness it has brought.

36:42.909 --> 36:43.743
[inhales deeply]

36:46.370 --> 36:51.042
Lately, I've been coming to understand
why people feel sad

36:51.125 --> 36:53.211
when they see a river flowing,

36:53.294 --> 36:56.130
a season passing by, and the sun setting.

36:59.717 --> 37:00.551
[Jang Uk sighs]

37:06.098 --> 37:08.601
Looking at this empty basket makes me sad.

37:08.684 --> 37:10.770
Mu-deok told me
to catch a lot of fish for her.

37:11.354 --> 37:13.731
Are you going to keep
that soul shifter by your side?

37:17.777 --> 37:20.154
Mu-deok and I both kept
our promise to you.

37:20.863 --> 37:22.740
I stood by the way of Naksu's sword,

37:22.823 --> 37:24.784
and Mu-deok lowered her blade on her own.

37:24.867 --> 37:30.164
So, I hope you will keep
your promise and just let both of us go.

37:30.248 --> 37:32.375
What happened to the ice stone that day?

37:33.501 --> 37:37.046
Is it not inside of your body, perhaps?

37:40.383 --> 37:42.385
[celestial music playing]

37:51.686 --> 37:53.813
Even if the ice stone is inside my body,

37:54.897 --> 37:56.899
it is completely useless to me.

37:56.983 --> 38:01.153
I can't even catch a waterdrop,
let alone a Golden Fish from this lake.

38:03.948 --> 38:08.035
[Master Lee] If you train again,
you may be able to use that power.

38:08.619 --> 38:10.663
I witnessed first-hand how that desire

38:10.746 --> 38:14.000
to harness that power made
human beings so violent and unsightly.

38:14.917 --> 38:18.087
It's only right to let it
be gone from this world.

38:20.131 --> 38:23.217
A boy who is greedy over a single fish

38:23.301 --> 38:25.303
has no desire for the ice stone?

38:25.386 --> 38:28.222
Ha! You are better than me, I guess.

38:31.475 --> 38:34.895
In any case,
since the ice stone is within me,

38:36.063 --> 38:38.232
I can protect at least
one person beside me.

38:39.317 --> 38:42.570
If Mu-deok runs wild by chance,

38:42.653 --> 38:46.115
please, help her use
this power to stop it, Master Lee.

38:46.198 --> 38:48.868
As long as she doesn't try
to bring out her power in that body,

38:48.951 --> 38:50.202
she will not run wild.

38:51.287 --> 38:54.915
Because the soul of an assassin
is in that tiny, weak body,

38:54.999 --> 38:57.710
if anything, she should have
run wild a long time ago.

38:57.793 --> 38:59.587
But the reason why she hasn't

38:59.670 --> 39:03.049
is that body is in control
of her soul's power.

39:04.675 --> 39:07.261
I saw that very clearly
on the day we first met.

39:12.641 --> 39:15.186
The ability to contain
the powers of a mage

39:15.269 --> 39:17.396
is the divine power of priestesses.

39:18.939 --> 39:22.151
It seems the original owner
of Mu-deok's body

39:22.902 --> 39:25.363
used to have
a great amount of divine powers.

39:35.331 --> 39:36.165
[breathes roughly]

39:42.421 --> 39:43.464
[So-i gasps softly]

39:49.428 --> 39:51.347
This will ease the pain
from the blood parasite.

39:52.515 --> 39:55.559
But only ease the pain,
it cannot get rid of it.

39:57.436 --> 39:59.438
I need to give this to him at least.

40:02.191 --> 40:03.234
[gasps]

40:06.779 --> 40:09.615
So, it turns out
you have dug your own grave.

40:09.698 --> 40:10.866
[breathes heavily]

40:11.951 --> 40:14.578
How dare you deceive me
pretending to be my daughter,

40:15.246 --> 40:16.122
So-i?

40:18.833 --> 40:20.251
But you were not fooled, Mother.

40:20.751 --> 40:23.504
You quickly realized,
but feigned ignorance.

40:25.047 --> 40:26.757
Was it all because of that rock?

40:28.426 --> 40:29.260
Right.

40:29.760 --> 40:32.888
A mother could never fail
to recognize her child.

40:34.557 --> 40:36.100
To stop any more trouble,

40:36.183 --> 40:39.854
it is best that you die here and now.

40:40.938 --> 40:41.772
[gasps]

40:41.856 --> 40:43.232
Can you also…

40:44.775 --> 40:46.068
recognize this?

40:46.902 --> 40:49.071
It is what Bu-yeon was wearing
the day she disappeared.

40:50.573 --> 40:52.491
You said you embroidered it yourself,
didn't you?

40:53.534 --> 40:54.410
[gasps]

40:55.619 --> 40:56.454
[gasps]

40:58.122 --> 40:59.039
[Ho-gyeong inhales sharply]

40:59.874 --> 41:01.083
[exclaims]

41:03.961 --> 41:06.130
You! Where did you get this?

41:06.672 --> 41:08.883
Did Jin Mu also put you up to this?

41:10.259 --> 41:11.135
[laughs]

41:11.218 --> 41:12.136
Oh, no.

41:13.137 --> 41:16.807
Only I know… who the owner is.

41:16.891 --> 41:18.100
Who is it? Tell me.

41:19.602 --> 41:21.437
Your daughter, Bu-yeon, is still alive.

41:23.063 --> 41:24.398
If you want to see her again,

41:25.149 --> 41:26.942
you cannot kill me.

41:29.528 --> 41:30.654
I'll spare you.

41:31.238 --> 41:33.073
Where is Bu-yeon? My Bu-yeon!

41:35.868 --> 41:37.203
[Ho-gyeong gasps]

41:37.286 --> 41:38.537
Don't rush me like this.

41:40.581 --> 41:44.293
I will tell you next time…
once I know I'm safe.

41:48.172 --> 41:49.507
[breathes shakily]

42:01.352 --> 42:02.978
[Jin] The ice stone has disappeared.

42:03.521 --> 42:06.148
But there are still
soul shifters created by

42:06.232 --> 42:08.400
the Choi family's secret organization.

42:09.109 --> 42:12.780
Songrim and Jinyowon will step forward
to get rid of them.

42:13.781 --> 42:16.617
I ask that you join
our cause, Your Highness.

42:20.287 --> 42:25.084
You are implying that I should not
protect Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu.

42:25.167 --> 42:29.755
I know he was your master but I believe
you didn't fall to his trickery.

42:32.258 --> 42:33.384
So you trust me?

42:34.843 --> 42:36.011
Then do you believe

42:37.096 --> 42:39.974
that I am truly the King's Star
who got rid of the ice stone?

42:44.687 --> 42:47.690
You were there
when the ice stone's barrier was lifted,

42:47.773 --> 42:50.276
and the King's Star appeared right then.

42:51.277 --> 42:55.072
So like everyone else,
I believe you are the King's Star.

42:59.910 --> 43:02.705
There was another person
in this place besides me.

43:03.998 --> 43:06.584
Who would mind them
when Your Royal Highness

43:07.876 --> 43:09.211
is the one who is here?

43:09.295 --> 43:11.297
That other person
who was there was Jang Uk.

43:12.298 --> 43:13.507
I am sure you saw him there.

43:15.926 --> 43:17.803
Jang Uk is like a son to me.

43:18.971 --> 43:21.223
Thanks to Your Highness, he is safe now.

43:22.224 --> 43:24.268
I am truly grateful for that.

43:26.312 --> 43:27.521
[sighs]

43:34.987 --> 43:37.740
I'm quitting my job
here at Songrim today, too.

43:37.823 --> 43:39.074
I came to resign.

43:39.158 --> 43:40.367
[laughs lightly]

43:40.451 --> 43:41.285
[smacks lips]

43:41.368 --> 43:44.580
Gosh, you went through
so much effort to finally land this job.

43:44.663 --> 43:46.999
It's really a shame you're quitting
because you're getting married.

43:47.666 --> 43:50.252
Then again, you are becoming
the lady of the Jang family.

43:50.336 --> 43:51.295
I suppose it's worth it.

43:53.172 --> 43:56.091
Oh! Mu-deok, congratulations.

43:56.175 --> 43:57.009
Be happy.

44:03.807 --> 44:05.643
[clears throat] All right, all right.
What are you doing, huh?

44:05.726 --> 44:06.560
Come along now.

44:07.311 --> 44:08.771
Hmm? Hurry up!

44:10.189 --> 44:11.023
[Eunuch Oh] Hurry up!

44:14.860 --> 44:17.404
[Mu-deok] Your Royal Highness,
thank you for saving my life.

44:17.905 --> 44:19.031
I am honored.

44:20.282 --> 44:23.619
May the light of the King's Star
shine forever and always!

44:23.702 --> 44:25.913
That is enough. Don't pretend.

44:26.497 --> 44:27.414
It's uncomfortable.

44:30.042 --> 44:33.379
You already know that it was Jang Uk
who saved everyone that day, not me.

44:33.462 --> 44:37.675
Just as you two have promised,
I won't tell anyone,

44:37.758 --> 44:38.926
so do not worry about it.

44:40.928 --> 44:41.970
Do you think I am worried

44:42.054 --> 44:44.181
because someone might find out
that I took the credit?

44:44.264 --> 44:46.892
I'm just annoyed in having to
sit and listen to everyone's flattery.

44:46.975 --> 44:49.269
They are all praising you
for doing a great job.

44:49.812 --> 44:53.065
You can just enjoy it
and accept it for what it is.

44:53.148 --> 44:55.943
It's very offensive to me to hear
such things from those strangers.

44:56.652 --> 44:58.362
And seeing how you bow before me…

45:00.489 --> 45:02.825
feels like you are mocking me,
and it makes my insides turn.

45:08.455 --> 45:10.541
I understand why you feel uncomfortable.

45:12.835 --> 45:15.421
You will actually never
have to see ever me again,

45:16.004 --> 45:17.089
so do not worry.

45:19.133 --> 45:20.008
I heard…

45:21.593 --> 45:24.096
- you are going far away with him.
- [Mu-deok] Yes, Your Highness.

45:24.179 --> 45:27.474
We are preparing to go and live together
somewhere far from the capital.

45:28.100 --> 45:29.143
Together?

45:29.810 --> 45:30.853
[Go Won scoffs]

45:32.020 --> 45:34.064
If I stop you, you cannot leave together.

45:34.815 --> 45:36.692
Do you really think I will let Jang Uk go

45:37.693 --> 45:39.319
even though he knows my weakness?

45:42.114 --> 45:44.658
Then how would it feel
to see that person by keeping

45:45.492 --> 45:46.535
them next to you?

45:49.580 --> 45:53.000
I imagine it would not stop at just making
your insides turn and offending you.

45:59.339 --> 46:00.174
Right.

46:00.841 --> 46:03.719
You are Filthy Mu-deok
who listens to all my petty complaints.

46:04.803 --> 46:06.805
Then, I would suggest
you listen to this as well.

46:07.639 --> 46:10.767
I will feel small knowing that he did
something that I failed to do.

46:11.393 --> 46:14.605
And pretending that I have done something
I did not will make me feel pathetic.

46:14.688 --> 46:15.606
But most of all…

46:17.774 --> 46:19.693
I will utterly despise…

46:21.862 --> 46:24.656
seeing you with him so much
I will be unable to bear it.

46:28.494 --> 46:29.578
I told you

46:29.661 --> 46:33.123
that I do not try to catch things
I know I will not be able to.

46:33.207 --> 46:35.959
Do you know what I do when I cannot
catch it even though I try?

46:37.836 --> 46:39.922
Will you blame
that person you cannot catch

46:41.298 --> 46:42.424
and get rid of them?

46:43.008 --> 46:46.845
If this pathetic, wretched feeling
turns into a violent and wicked one…

46:49.640 --> 46:52.684
simply avoiding me will never
be enough to keep you safe.

46:55.312 --> 46:57.439
You need to disappear to a faraway place…

46:59.233 --> 47:00.526
out of my reach.

47:09.868 --> 47:10.827
[sighs]

47:14.790 --> 47:15.791
Guys…

47:17.042 --> 47:20.379
- I am getting married tomorrow!
- [Jang Uk] Yeah, yeah, wow.

47:22.881 --> 47:23.715
[clicks tongue]

47:24.216 --> 47:26.093
[sighs] You little boys.

47:26.176 --> 47:29.805
I suppose I will not get to see
you guys like this often anymore.

47:29.888 --> 47:30.806
[Jang Uk] Of course not.

47:30.889 --> 47:33.934
There's no way Cho-yeon would ever
let you have fun like this.

47:34.017 --> 47:35.811
- Neither will his mother-in-law.
- No, hmm.

47:35.894 --> 47:36.895
[Seo Yul exclaims]

47:36.979 --> 47:38.564
He will no longer
have the pleasure to come

47:39.273 --> 47:40.899
- to our gyeokgu matches, for sure.
- [Jang Uk] Hmm.

47:40.983 --> 47:43.026
We definitely won't be able
to invite him to fishing.

47:44.027 --> 47:47.030
Well, I can still make time
and see you guys now and then.

47:47.114 --> 47:47.948
[Seo Yul] What will you tell her?

47:48.031 --> 47:49.866
- That you are training or something?
- [chuckles softly]

47:49.950 --> 47:52.744
Are you seriously going to lie
to a Jinyowon priestess?

47:52.828 --> 47:53.704
He will be caught right away.

47:53.787 --> 47:57.124
Cho-yeon will grab you and surround you
with relics from Jinyowon, huh?

47:57.207 --> 47:58.667
She will demand the truth from you,

47:58.750 --> 48:00.502
and then, you will be bewitched
and tell her everything.

48:01.086 --> 48:03.797
- Then she will pull out all of--
- His hair, his hair, his hair!

48:03.880 --> 48:04.881
Oh, dear, that is--

48:04.965 --> 48:06.717
He doesn't even have
that much hair, to begin with.

48:06.800 --> 48:07.634
[Seo Yul clicks tongue]

48:08.135 --> 48:09.052
[exhales]

48:09.886 --> 48:11.555
[laughs]

48:11.638 --> 48:13.849
Ah, I see. You are just envious.

48:14.933 --> 48:16.935
I am still happy

48:17.019 --> 48:19.771
because my first love
has really come true.

48:20.647 --> 48:24.818
I will share lots of my good energy
and luck with you bachelors, huh?

48:26.153 --> 48:27.195
[grunts]

48:27.279 --> 48:30.282
- I caught it.
- Oh, right, Uk, you have Mu-deok.

48:30.365 --> 48:32.451
- [Jang Uk] That's right.
- And she is not your first.

48:32.534 --> 48:35.245
- She is, what, your eighth love?
- [stammers] No.

48:35.329 --> 48:37.205
You better not say that
to Mu-deok, or else I'll kill you.

48:37.289 --> 48:39.666
Ah, okay, okay. All right. Forget it then.

48:39.750 --> 48:42.252
Yul, you can take my energy. Ah, take it!

48:42.336 --> 48:43.170
That's fine.

48:44.504 --> 48:45.631
I was rejected.

48:45.714 --> 48:46.882
What?

48:46.965 --> 48:47.841
By whom?

48:49.259 --> 48:50.886
N-not by Mu-deok?

48:52.679 --> 48:53.513
Oh…

48:54.264 --> 48:55.766
[sighs lightly] No, not that.

48:56.558 --> 48:59.478
The woman I had feelings for
was not Mu-deok.

49:01.021 --> 49:01.980
[Dang-gu] Oh…

49:03.315 --> 49:05.651
Um, well, who then?

49:06.652 --> 49:08.236
Hey, Uk, do you know?

49:08.862 --> 49:10.739
Well, um, I guess I have a hunch.

49:11.782 --> 49:12.866
[Dang-gu] Oh.

49:15.744 --> 49:19.206
So, have you decided
where you are going with Mu-deok?

49:19.289 --> 49:21.875
Well, we are thinking of Sari Village.

49:21.958 --> 49:23.418
There's something that
I want to ask around.

49:23.502 --> 49:26.838
Then, are you all prepared to go
back to Seoho Fortress now?

49:27.547 --> 49:29.675
You said you would be leaving
right after my wedding, Yul?

49:29.758 --> 49:31.218
It seems like I will have to delay.

49:32.052 --> 49:33.595
I might need more treatment.

49:33.679 --> 49:34.888
What? Does it still hurt?

49:35.389 --> 49:37.224
I heard the wound had
already healed, though.

49:37.307 --> 49:39.726
- [Seo Yul sighs]
- What? Is Master Heo a quack?

49:40.560 --> 49:43.563
The wound has healed,
but I still feel some pain.

49:45.190 --> 49:46.149
I will be fine.

49:54.783 --> 49:56.702
[huffs, breathes heavily]

50:00.747 --> 50:01.915
[Ju-wol] Young Master Seo.

50:03.333 --> 50:05.502
I do not know
if I should give this to you.

50:05.585 --> 50:08.922
But a beggar I met on the side of the road
pleaded with me to deliver this.

50:20.976 --> 50:22.352
[So-i] This medicine will relieve

50:22.436 --> 50:24.771
the tightening pain
you feel around your heart.

50:25.313 --> 50:26.648
You must take it.

50:28.316 --> 50:30.235
[Seo Yul] It is someone
who knows my current condition.

50:31.111 --> 50:31.945
Who could it be?

50:38.827 --> 50:39.661
[breathes heavily]

50:43.540 --> 50:46.168
I knew you would come back
to see me, Your Royal Highness.

50:47.961 --> 50:51.173
There is nothing that Jang Uk can do,
so I will cast him far away.

50:51.256 --> 50:53.508
As for the ice stone, he doesn't have it.

50:54.092 --> 50:56.470
Come forward and pay for your crimes
by the end of the day.

50:57.012 --> 50:58.096
And if you do not…

51:00.640 --> 51:02.559
I will have to capture my own master.

51:05.854 --> 51:08.106
Everyone is deceiving you.

51:11.067 --> 51:13.445
Did you meet with Songrim's leader today?

51:13.987 --> 51:15.655
What did he say to you?

51:15.739 --> 51:18.867
Did he congratulate you
for being the real King's Star?

51:19.743 --> 51:23.413
He is well aware that
it's not you, but it is Jang Uk.

51:25.791 --> 51:27.501
Do you think Master Lee does not know?

51:28.126 --> 51:29.336
He barged into the palace

51:29.419 --> 51:32.380
and mentioned the King's Star,
all the while knowing.

51:35.425 --> 51:38.970
Are you saying that they all deceived me
and have been mocking me this whole time?

51:39.054 --> 51:41.348
They are hiding it to protect him.

51:42.057 --> 51:45.352
Jang Uk has the power
of the ice stone and Songrim's protection.

51:45.435 --> 51:48.480
The only one you can trust
to protect you is just me, Jin Mu.

51:53.485 --> 51:55.654
Jang Uk is hiding something tremendous.

51:56.446 --> 51:57.697
I will expose it…

51:59.533 --> 52:05.330
and… send him all the way
to rock bottom where he belongs.

52:05.413 --> 52:07.415
[ominous music playing]

52:15.006 --> 52:16.007
[maid Kim] That's right.

52:17.092 --> 52:19.511
Huh, what? Who drank it all?

52:19.594 --> 52:20.804
Your glass is empty.

52:20.887 --> 52:22.973
It was you? You drank it all.

52:23.598 --> 52:25.183
[maid Kim] Empty! Pour me some, then.

52:25.267 --> 52:26.685
- Right.
- Have some.

52:26.768 --> 52:29.312
"Have some"? How dare you say that?

52:29.396 --> 52:31.606
- "Have some"?
- [Mu-deok] What will you do about it?

52:32.148 --> 52:33.859
[maid Kim] Oh, Young Master Jang.

52:34.401 --> 52:38.905
Young Master Jang, hah,
we were having a drink to celebrate

52:38.989 --> 52:41.616
- Mu-deok's resignation from Songrim today.
- Huh.

52:41.700 --> 52:44.202
- Hi, Jang Uk.
- Hey!

52:44.786 --> 52:46.913
- How dare you call him "Jang Uk"?
- [Mu-deok] Ah!

52:47.455 --> 52:50.041
Sorry. My mistake.

52:50.125 --> 52:52.252
- [maid Kim] That's right.
- These two have had a few drinks.

52:52.335 --> 52:55.547
Oh, Young Master Jang.
Come here. Come, come!

52:55.630 --> 52:57.966
[maid Kim laughs]

52:58.550 --> 53:02.053
Let me show you something really so cool.

53:02.137 --> 53:03.597
When Mu-deok is drunk…

53:03.680 --> 53:06.766
- Hmm?
- …she does not speak in dialect at all.

53:06.850 --> 53:08.351
- [maid Kim laughs]
- Oh!

53:08.435 --> 53:10.020
Is that fascinating?

53:10.604 --> 53:11.688
- A pity…
- Huh?

53:11.771 --> 53:13.773
…that I cannot show you.

53:15.108 --> 53:17.944
But I can fly up to that roof.

53:18.028 --> 53:20.322
The roof? Really? Go try it.

53:20.405 --> 53:22.240
- Try it?
- Try it.

53:23.575 --> 53:24.534
Watch closely.

53:25.201 --> 53:26.036
Huh?

53:28.622 --> 53:29.539
[inhales deeply]

53:30.123 --> 53:31.041
[Mu-deok grunts]

53:31.666 --> 53:33.877
- Darn it. Hold on. Damn it.
- [Jang Uk] Oh.

53:35.045 --> 53:35.921
[grunts]

53:36.630 --> 53:38.048
- Oh, you-- All right.
- [Mu-deok] It's not working, it's not.

53:38.131 --> 53:39.090
Just sit.

53:39.174 --> 53:41.301
[groans lightly]

53:42.844 --> 53:44.763
Cannot draw my sword either.

53:44.846 --> 53:46.514
[maid Kim] What? That?

53:46.598 --> 53:47.807
That sword is not yours.

53:47.891 --> 53:49.184
- That was Naksu's.
- [sighs]

53:50.018 --> 53:51.353
- Young Master.
- Oh, yes?

53:51.436 --> 53:55.649
Why do you keep bringing that thing
in here when I told you it's hideous?

53:55.732 --> 53:57.609
Oh, right. I'm going
to get rid of it. I will.

53:57.692 --> 53:58.526
[Mu-deok sighs]

53:58.610 --> 54:00.278
- Let me try it again.
- Go on.

54:00.362 --> 54:02.364
- Sure. Try it. Fly.
- [Mu-deok] Let me try.

54:02.447 --> 54:03.657
- [sighs]
- [maid Kim] Go on.

54:04.282 --> 54:05.116
[both] Up!

54:05.784 --> 54:06.785
- [Mu-deok] Oh.
- [Jang Uk] Ugh, there.

54:06.868 --> 54:07.744
- Wow.
- [maid Kim] Huh?

54:07.827 --> 54:10.205
- Maidservant Kim, please, clean this up.
- [Mu-deok] Did you see that?

54:10.288 --> 54:12.082
- [Jang Uk] I'll take care of Mu-deok.
- Wait, I can fly.

54:12.165 --> 54:14.084
- [Jang Uk] And do not fly, do not fly.
- I told you.

54:14.167 --> 54:16.044
She really, really did fly.

54:17.170 --> 54:19.172
Lord Park, did you see that?

54:19.255 --> 54:21.007
I want you to fly with me.

54:21.091 --> 54:24.052
You guys have no idea who I am.

54:24.135 --> 54:27.222
I am the true master of it all.
I'll show you.

54:30.767 --> 54:31.893
I am the master.

54:31.977 --> 54:34.229
Not working. Today is not my day.

54:34.312 --> 54:35.146
[laughs]

54:39.859 --> 54:40.944
[Jang Uk sighs]

54:41.486 --> 54:43.571
Mu-deok, do not drink ever again.

54:43.655 --> 54:45.615
You'll tell everyone that
you are actually Naksu.

54:45.699 --> 54:46.533
Huh.

54:48.451 --> 54:50.203
I have something to tell you.

54:50.286 --> 54:51.955
Sleep now. Tell me tomorrow.

54:53.665 --> 54:54.874
I must say it now.

54:55.500 --> 54:58.378
What if I do not tell you
and then I die tomorrow?

54:59.045 --> 55:01.423
Fine, tell me. Before you die, go on.

55:01.506 --> 55:02.340
Tell me.

55:07.178 --> 55:08.013
Listen.

55:11.516 --> 55:13.101
Jang Uk, I like you a lot.

55:27.949 --> 55:28.783
[scoffs]

55:31.494 --> 55:33.788
Oh! Oh, I see. And now, it's bedtime.

55:33.872 --> 55:35.749
You do that and just fall asleep?

55:37.292 --> 55:38.126
[sighs]

55:38.710 --> 55:41.254
I need to tell her
what Master Lee said, too.

55:43.465 --> 55:46.551
[Master Lee] It seems
the original owner of Mu-deok's body

55:47.052 --> 55:49.304
used to have
a great amount of divine powers.

55:50.764 --> 55:53.099
We will find out
once I get to Sari Village with you.

55:54.684 --> 55:55.769
Hmm.

56:00.774 --> 56:01.608
Hmm.

56:16.664 --> 56:17.999
[bell jingling]

56:20.168 --> 56:22.128
[ominous music playing]

56:25.215 --> 56:26.466
[bell jingling continues]

57:13.555 --> 57:15.515
[all cheering]

57:24.858 --> 57:26.234
[man] Be happy!

57:35.910 --> 57:39.038
Both of you, let bygones be bygones.

57:39.122 --> 57:41.332
And be good in-laws to each other.

57:42.667 --> 57:45.211
Our Cho-yeon is not marrying
into the Park family.

57:45.795 --> 57:48.631
Park Dang-gu is the one
who is marrying into ours.

57:49.757 --> 57:51.050
He's not moving to Jinyowon.

57:51.801 --> 57:54.762
It's because you keep saying
such things that people are talking

57:54.846 --> 57:57.432
about how Park Dang-gu
is to become Jin Dang-gu.

57:59.142 --> 58:01.686
Their daughter will be given our surname.

58:01.769 --> 58:03.104
Their son will have ours.

58:03.188 --> 58:06.858
Hey, now! You are arguing again! Why now?

58:06.941 --> 58:08.860
The guests will be arriving soon.

58:08.943 --> 58:11.196
You should go get ready to greet them.

58:11.863 --> 58:14.240
[Heo Yeom] Go on. Go, go, go!

58:16.784 --> 58:17.619
[Jang Uk] Where is Dang-gu?

58:18.119 --> 58:20.163
He said he is going
to Sejukwon with Cho-yeon first.

58:20.747 --> 58:23.458
They're going to sneak inside
to pay respects to her father.

58:23.541 --> 58:24.542
[chuckles]

58:24.626 --> 58:25.668
Where is Mu-deok?

58:27.504 --> 58:29.964
I don't know. I thought she went ahead,
but I haven't seen her.

58:31.549 --> 58:34.052
Is she avoiding me now
because of last night?

58:35.053 --> 58:35.887
[chuckles]

58:44.020 --> 58:45.480
[bell jingling]

58:53.196 --> 58:55.198
[eerie music playing]

59:05.333 --> 59:06.793
[bell jingling continues]

59:38.741 --> 59:39.576
Naksu.

59:40.994 --> 59:43.871
You cannot draw your sword
because you are stuck in that body.

59:45.081 --> 59:47.375
You are my last weapon anyway.

59:48.251 --> 59:51.212
I will use all my power
to help bring out yours.

59:52.171 --> 59:53.965
So once you regain your energy,

59:55.049 --> 59:56.175
run wild.

01:00:09.939 --> 01:00:11.941
[dramatic music playing]

01:00:18.698 --> 01:00:19.532
[grunts]

01:00:27.123 --> 01:00:29.167
[dramatic music continues playing]

01:00:54.108 --> 01:00:57.111
[So-i] Only I know who the owner is.

01:00:57.862 --> 01:00:59.822
Your daughter, Bu-yeon, is still alive.

01:01:01.199 --> 01:01:02.241
Oh, Mother.

01:01:08.122 --> 01:01:08.998
[sighs]

01:01:13.461 --> 01:01:14.420
Maidservant Kim.

01:01:20.635 --> 01:01:23.805
Where did that servant,
Mu-deok, use to live?

01:01:25.264 --> 01:01:28.101
Does she… have parents?

01:01:29.060 --> 01:01:32.313
No, she does not.
I heard she grew up in Sari Village.

01:01:33.481 --> 01:01:35.942
I told you all of this before
when she was falsely accused

01:01:36.025 --> 01:01:37.318
because of that girl, So-i.

01:01:38.361 --> 01:01:39.737
I asked you to help that girl.

01:01:40.905 --> 01:01:42.365
You didn't pretend to hear me.

01:01:43.658 --> 01:01:46.327
Does So-i know about Mu-deok?

01:01:47.120 --> 01:01:50.039
Right. Young Lady Jin also knows her.

01:01:56.170 --> 01:01:57.880
[Dang-gu] You are so beautiful.

01:01:58.589 --> 01:01:59.507
[chuckles]

01:02:00.174 --> 01:02:03.010
Well, you are handsome as well.

01:02:06.431 --> 01:02:08.850
Uh, let us go and greet your father.

01:02:09.892 --> 01:02:11.644
We cannot stay there for long.

01:02:12.228 --> 01:02:14.856
If the others find out,
they will give us an earful.

01:02:15.982 --> 01:02:16.816
Yes.

01:02:17.984 --> 01:02:19.110
Thank you so much…

01:02:20.653 --> 01:02:23.114
hus-ba-- husband.

01:02:23.865 --> 01:02:25.366
[giggles]

01:02:25.450 --> 01:02:26.659
Oh.

01:02:28.578 --> 01:02:29.579
[Dang-gu] Be careful…

01:02:31.706 --> 01:02:32.540
my wife.

01:02:33.791 --> 01:02:34.876
My dear wife.

01:02:36.335 --> 01:02:37.670
[stutters] Oh, wait for me.

01:02:43.050 --> 01:02:46.053
Mu-deok? What are you doing here?

01:02:51.642 --> 01:02:54.812
Mu-deok, you cannot bring that in here.

01:02:54.896 --> 01:02:55.772
[doctor Seo screams]

01:02:57.648 --> 01:02:59.817
[Jin Mu] First, kill Jin U-tak.

01:03:01.986 --> 01:03:03.446
[doctor Seo groans]

01:03:05.907 --> 01:03:06.866
[doctor Seo] Mu-deok!

01:03:08.993 --> 01:03:10.077
[mages grunt]

01:03:12.246 --> 01:03:13.539
- [sword sloshes]
- [mage 1 groans]

01:03:21.214 --> 01:03:22.089
[mage 2 groans]

01:03:37.897 --> 01:03:39.315
[U-tak] What is happening?

01:03:41.818 --> 01:03:42.652
You…

01:03:43.694 --> 01:03:45.613
you are Jang Uk's servant, right?

01:03:46.197 --> 01:03:47.323
What's going on?

01:03:47.824 --> 01:03:49.826
[eerie music playing]

01:03:51.953 --> 01:03:53.204
[U-tak breathes heavily]

01:04:06.092 --> 01:04:06.926
[yells]

01:04:07.510 --> 01:04:08.970
[coughs]

01:04:10.555 --> 01:04:11.848
[U-tak pants]

01:04:13.391 --> 01:04:14.892
[Jin Mu] Kill Jin U-tak.

01:04:22.942 --> 01:04:24.068
[gasps]
Father!

01:04:26.237 --> 01:04:27.405
[Cho-yeon] Father!

01:04:27.947 --> 01:04:29.156
[U-tak coughs]

01:04:30.616 --> 01:04:31.701
Mu-deok.

01:04:31.784 --> 01:04:32.869
What are you doing?

01:04:32.952 --> 01:04:33.828
She is…

01:04:34.537 --> 01:04:37.248
she is an assassin.

01:04:37.999 --> 01:04:39.166
Run, Cho-yeon.

01:04:39.250 --> 01:04:40.459
Go, now!

01:04:42.962 --> 01:04:44.297
[grunts]

01:04:48.301 --> 01:04:49.135
[Cho-yeon groans]

01:05:05.443 --> 01:05:06.694
[Cho-yeon] Young Master Park!

01:05:06.777 --> 01:05:07.945
You need to stop Mu-deok.

01:05:11.657 --> 01:05:12.491
Mu-deok.

01:05:15.328 --> 01:05:16.579
[Cho-yeon] Please, stop her!

01:05:46.817 --> 01:05:47.902
[groans]

01:05:47.985 --> 01:05:49.987
Kill her. Hurry!

01:05:54.158 --> 01:05:55.242
[Dang-gu grunts]

01:05:56.577 --> 01:05:57.411
[groans]

01:05:58.746 --> 01:05:59.580
[gasps]

01:06:00.706 --> 01:06:01.540
[gasps]

01:06:04.543 --> 01:06:05.419
[grunts]

01:06:07.546 --> 01:06:08.756
Father!

01:06:10.049 --> 01:06:11.926
- [Cho-yeon] Father! Father!
- [U-tak groans]

01:06:12.635 --> 01:06:13.469
Father!

01:06:15.304 --> 01:06:16.138
Father!

01:06:17.723 --> 01:06:19.517
Father!
[cries]

01:06:21.227 --> 01:06:22.603
Father! No!

01:06:23.229 --> 01:06:24.814
- Father!
- [groans]

01:06:30.653 --> 01:06:32.196
Father!

01:06:35.199 --> 01:06:36.200
[young Naksu] Yes, daddy.

01:06:36.993 --> 01:06:37.910
[pants]

01:06:42.415 --> 01:06:43.582
[bell jingling]

01:06:43.666 --> 01:06:45.292
- [Cho-yeon] Father, no!
- [moans in pain]

01:06:45.835 --> 01:06:47.586
- [sobs]
- [bell jingling]

01:06:49.755 --> 01:06:50.673
[Jin Mu] Naksu.

01:06:52.299 --> 01:06:54.719
Kill those who murdered your father.

01:07:00.099 --> 01:07:01.308
[Cho-yeon] Father!

01:07:02.143 --> 01:07:03.352
[sobs]

01:07:03.436 --> 01:07:04.687
Father!

01:07:06.063 --> 01:07:06.897
Father!

01:07:07.398 --> 01:07:09.400
[tense music playing]

01:07:14.697 --> 01:07:15.948
[pants]

01:07:19.869 --> 01:07:21.537
[suspenseful music playing]

01:07:36.969 --> 01:07:38.971
How dare you show your face here?

01:07:40.431 --> 01:07:41.974
Capture that criminal Jin Mu!

01:07:43.059 --> 01:07:45.102
I, Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu,

01:07:45.186 --> 01:07:47.063
am here to catch a soul shifter.

01:07:49.648 --> 01:07:52.985
Naksu, who has shifted her soul,
is hidden within the walls of Songrim.

01:07:54.111 --> 01:07:56.155
- Naksu?
- [doctor Seo] Lord Park!

01:07:56.238 --> 01:07:57.114
[pants]

01:07:58.074 --> 01:07:58.949
[groans]

01:08:00.701 --> 01:08:01.744
We have a problem.

01:08:02.244 --> 01:08:04.747
An assassin has appeared in Sejukwon.

01:08:05.748 --> 01:08:07.083
[doctor Seo breathes heavily]

01:08:07.166 --> 01:08:10.336
And that assassin has murdered
Lord Jin in cold blood.

01:08:11.337 --> 01:08:14.215
That very assassin is the one
I have been after. Naksu.

01:08:14.965 --> 01:08:15.841
[doctor Seo] That's not true.

01:08:16.675 --> 01:08:17.551
It was…

01:08:18.219 --> 01:08:19.428
it was Mu-deok who did it.

01:08:19.512 --> 01:08:21.222
Indeed. I am saying that Mu-deok…

01:08:22.098 --> 01:08:23.307
is Naksu.

01:08:29.772 --> 01:08:30.606
[Beom pants]

01:08:30.689 --> 01:08:31.732
An assassin!

01:08:32.399 --> 01:08:34.276
An assassin has appeared in Sejukwon!

01:08:34.360 --> 01:08:35.736
[Beom pants]

01:08:47.373 --> 01:08:48.290
[groans]

01:08:54.171 --> 01:08:55.172
[Cho-yeon grunts]

01:09:06.934 --> 01:09:08.352
- Get her.
- [mages grunting]

01:09:18.571 --> 01:09:20.573
[tense music playing]

01:09:30.374 --> 01:09:31.959
- After her!
- [mages] Yes, sir!

01:09:38.132 --> 01:09:39.425
[mages grunting]

01:09:47.391 --> 01:09:48.392
[mages yell]

01:09:59.528 --> 01:10:00.362
[mage grunts]

01:10:22.968 --> 01:10:24.053
[grunts]

01:10:27.223 --> 01:10:28.182
[breathes heavily]

01:10:28.849 --> 01:10:30.935
[tense music playing]

01:10:39.735 --> 01:10:40.819
[grunts]

01:10:55.668 --> 01:10:57.670
[somber music playing]

01:11:05.219 --> 01:11:06.095
[grunts]

01:11:07.763 --> 01:11:09.223
[breathes shakily]

01:11:12.142 --> 01:11:13.227
[stammers] Mu-deok.

01:11:16.230 --> 01:11:17.064
Mu…

01:11:17.147 --> 01:11:18.065
Mu-deok.

01:11:21.485 --> 01:11:22.403
Mu-deok.

01:11:27.157 --> 01:11:27.992
Mu-deok.

01:11:34.081 --> 01:11:34.915
Jang Uk?

01:11:44.341 --> 01:11:45.301
[Jang Uk grunts in pain]

01:11:46.552 --> 01:11:47.428
[gasps]

01:11:49.430 --> 01:11:50.764
I did this, right?

01:11:52.474 --> 01:11:53.434
I did this.

01:11:55.060 --> 01:11:55.894
[sobbing]

01:11:55.978 --> 01:11:56.979
I…

01:11:58.939 --> 01:12:00.441
[breathes heavily]

01:12:18.667 --> 01:12:19.501
[Jang Uk] Just one.

01:12:22.254 --> 01:12:25.132
You are the one that
I will be wearing for the rest of my life.

01:12:26.008 --> 01:12:28.594
I have never given
such a ring to anyone else.

01:12:31.847 --> 01:12:34.099
[Mu-deok] It means if I become Naksu,
I'll be in danger.

01:12:34.683 --> 01:12:37.978
What happens to me then
will have nothing to do with you.

01:12:40.689 --> 01:12:41.523
[Jang Uk] Why?

01:12:42.107 --> 01:12:44.318
Because we will no longer be
master and pupil?

01:12:44.401 --> 01:12:46.195
You will no longer have to protect me.

01:12:46.737 --> 01:12:48.989
Nor will I have a reason
to go easy on you.

01:12:50.240 --> 01:12:52.451
Because that was our promise
from the very beginning.

01:12:52.951 --> 01:12:54.328
[Jang Uk] Then promise me one more thing.

01:12:54.828 --> 01:12:56.288
When you regain your energy,

01:12:56.997 --> 01:12:59.249
if you must draw that sword
and point it at someone,

01:13:00.542 --> 01:13:02.252
point it at me before anyone else.

01:13:03.587 --> 01:13:04.671
You stab me,

01:13:04.755 --> 01:13:07.174
and I'll take responsibility
for setting Naksu upon the world,

01:13:08.175 --> 01:13:09.051
and I will die.

01:13:16.141 --> 01:13:17.142
Jang Uk!

01:13:17.810 --> 01:13:19.978
[cries]

01:13:21.605 --> 01:13:22.815
Jang Uk!

01:13:23.649 --> 01:13:24.775
[Mu-deok wailing]

01:13:37.996 --> 01:13:39.998
[bell jingling]

01:13:41.917 --> 01:13:42.960
[moans]

01:13:43.752 --> 01:13:45.087
[breathes heavily]

01:13:45.754 --> 01:13:47.464
[bell jingling]

01:13:49.007 --> 01:13:50.968
[suspenseful music playing]

01:14:28.797 --> 01:14:29.715
[mage] After her!

01:14:36.638 --> 01:14:38.640
[somber music playing]

01:15:12.341 --> 01:15:13.550
[Jin sobs] Uk…

01:15:21.016 --> 01:15:22.476
Uk!

01:16:14.778 --> 01:16:15.612
I think…

01:16:19.157 --> 01:16:22.369
somehow, Uk always knew
that Mu-deok was Naksu.

01:16:24.079 --> 01:16:25.163
Jin Mu…

01:16:26.498 --> 01:16:29.459
is raiding Jeongjingak
to find proof of that as we speak.

01:16:35.007 --> 01:16:36.550
I was aware of it as well.

01:16:37.759 --> 01:16:39.595
Please, allow me to go and find her

01:16:39.678 --> 01:16:41.847
and find out
what it is that really happened.

01:16:42.347 --> 01:16:45.350
You are Seo family's heir.

01:16:46.351 --> 01:16:49.104
You did not know anything.

01:16:49.688 --> 01:16:50.522
[sighs]

01:16:50.606 --> 01:16:53.567
From this moment on, you are forbidden
from leaving the premises.

01:17:05.579 --> 01:17:06.788
[Cho-yeon] Father died

01:17:07.581 --> 01:17:09.791
at the hands of that assassin.

01:17:10.876 --> 01:17:12.169
I will confront her

01:17:13.420 --> 01:17:15.380
and kill her no matter what.

01:17:18.258 --> 01:17:19.301
No, you can't.

01:17:22.763 --> 01:17:26.433
We must find that body
and bring it here alive.

01:17:28.602 --> 01:17:31.563
Naksu is just the soul
that's in that body.

01:17:32.230 --> 01:17:35.359
I must find out who that body belonged to.

01:17:37.861 --> 01:17:40.364
Bring her… at all costs.

01:17:50.666 --> 01:17:53.293
The assassin who performed
the alchemy of souls

01:17:53.377 --> 01:17:55.629
turned out to be Naksu.

01:17:56.463 --> 01:18:00.050
I captured an individual
when I killed Naksu's men.

01:18:00.133 --> 01:18:02.803
And that was how I knew
that Naksu was still alive.

01:18:03.512 --> 01:18:06.014
All this time,
I've been searching for Naksu

01:18:06.098 --> 01:18:07.683
in order to clear my name.

01:18:07.766 --> 01:18:11.436
And this Naksu was the daughter
of Cho Chung killed by the four families?

01:18:12.312 --> 01:18:15.440
[queen] And she was hiding
in Songrim to avenge her father?

01:18:16.316 --> 01:18:19.069
Did Jang Uk keep her
by his side despite knowing this?

01:18:19.152 --> 01:18:20.946
We will never know since he has died.

01:18:21.029 --> 01:18:24.658
But I ask that
you punish Songrim for this.

01:18:26.284 --> 01:18:27.244
[sighs]

01:18:29.204 --> 01:18:30.747
And what happened to Naksu?

01:18:30.831 --> 01:18:32.833
Cheonbugwan's men are after her.

01:18:33.417 --> 01:18:37.838
She has run wild,
so she will be petrified and die.

01:18:41.508 --> 01:18:42.426
[sighs]

01:18:55.105 --> 01:18:56.148
[Jang Uk stutters] Mu-deok.

01:18:59.693 --> 01:19:01.278
Mu… Mu-deok.

01:19:01.361 --> 01:19:02.988
[bell jingling]

01:19:03.071 --> 01:19:04.072
[groans]

01:19:05.907 --> 01:19:06.867
Jang Uk!

01:19:07.367 --> 01:19:09.369
[tense music playing]

01:19:12.164 --> 01:19:13.874
[breathes heavily]

01:19:27.137 --> 01:19:31.099
[sobbing] I'm not even allowed
to wear mourning clothes

01:19:31.683 --> 01:19:33.894
nor give him a proper funeral.

01:19:34.644 --> 01:19:37.731
How can they burn the young master's body
in such a place?

01:19:38.231 --> 01:19:39.691
[maid Kim sobbing]

01:19:40.192 --> 01:19:41.526
That cannot happen!

01:19:42.527 --> 01:19:44.488
I beg you, stop them, please!

01:19:46.114 --> 01:19:47.491
Songrim can't…

01:19:49.034 --> 01:19:49.993
step in…

01:19:51.703 --> 01:19:53.163
- on this matter at all.
- [maid Kim wails]

01:19:55.332 --> 01:19:56.291
I am sorry.

01:20:13.642 --> 01:20:15.101
[maid Kim cries]

01:20:16.478 --> 01:20:17.687
Young Master…

01:20:34.579 --> 01:20:35.747
[sobs]

01:20:47.759 --> 01:20:48.927
[Seo Yul sobbing]

01:21:01.064 --> 01:21:03.066
[somber music playing]

01:21:19.624 --> 01:21:21.793
What am I doing here right now?

01:21:26.464 --> 01:21:27.549
At least…

01:21:31.636 --> 01:21:33.972
I can no longer hear the bells anymore.

01:21:39.978 --> 01:21:42.397
Naksu will go to the soul shifters' grave.

01:21:43.189 --> 01:21:46.318
There she'll meet… her end.

01:22:02.292 --> 01:22:05.253
The King's Star who has been
granted the power of the skies.

01:22:06.630 --> 01:22:09.466
This is not your end yet…

01:22:10.967 --> 01:22:11.843
Jang Uk.

01:22:13.219 --> 01:22:15.221
[suspenseful music playing]

01:22:26.691 --> 01:22:27.776
- [loud rumble]
- [all gasp]

01:22:27.859 --> 01:22:29.861
[crowd clamoring]

01:22:30.904 --> 01:22:31.863
[woman] Get out of here!

01:22:33.406 --> 01:22:34.449
Please, be careful.

01:22:40.163 --> 01:22:41.331
Young Master Jang.

01:22:42.791 --> 01:22:44.793
[epic music playing]

01:23:14.614 --> 01:23:15.824
[all scream]

01:23:54.487 --> 01:23:56.740
[epic music playing]

01:25:10.438 --> 01:25:12.440
[closing theme music playing]

01:26:18.339 --> 01:26:22.385
A NEW ALCHEMY OF SOULS STORY
WILL BEGIN IN DECEMBER

01:26:22.468 --> 01:26:23.303
[shouts]

01:26:24.554 --> 01:26:25.638
[man shouts]

01:26:31.477 --> 01:26:33.313
[intense music playing]
